@startuml
!theme plain
title OpenData Version 3.0.0 Operational Lifecycle
start
:Deploy compatible source/package, SQL schema and documentation;
:Use Java 24 or later;
:Replace bootstrap credential and certificate/private key;
:Verify registry migration, grants, directories and backup;
if (Required plugins registered?) then (no)
  :Register from GUI discovery/file
or CLI --plugin id|all --register;
endif
:Review registered plugins;
:Enable/disable intended operational set;
:Run GUI Dry-run or CLI --plugin all --dry-run;
if (Acceptance successful?) then (yes)
  :Run one controlled write per enabled plugin;
  :Verify live/application logs, audit, registry, business data and archives;
  if (Warnings or mismatches?) then (yes)
    :Stop writes and retain evidence;
    :Reconcile transactions, ledgers and archives;
  else (no)
    :Permit routine GUI/CLI operation and monitor;
  endif
else (no)
  :Diagnose registry, configuration, source and parser failures;
endif
stop
@enduml
